Additional note (not a legal term, just a heads-up): this repository contains circuit
designs and wiring instructions for electronics projects, including some that reference
mains-voltage (100-240V) devices. Designs are provided for educational purposes. Verify
all wiring yourself before powering anything on. Any project involving mains voltage
should use certified relay/smart-plug hardware rather than direct hand-wiring — see the
agent prompt's safety rules for details.
